// Extended magazine — a longer box magazine paired with a stripper-clip guide: adds capacity
// (more rounds before a reload) AND speeds the reload (the clip guide makes the swap quicker).
// GTW-549 data-driven attachment ITEM demonstrating a MULTI-effect item; both magnitudes live
// HERE on the item, never in global tuning. Referenced by a weapon BY KEY (`extended_mag`) in
// its `attachments:` list; both effects are applied to the spawned weapon post-spawn.
(
    display_name: "Extended Magazine",
    effects: [
        ExtraAmmo(8),      // +8 magazine capacity — tunable
        ReloadTime(0.8),   // ×0.8 the weapon's reload_tu (< 1 = faster) — tunable
    ],
)
